== Deborah Anne Kirwan Pool schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swim"
- IGNORED date-context "Saturday, May 16 and Sunday, May 17"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim"
- NOTICE "See Victoria Day weekend schedule."
    date text: "Saturday, May 16 and Sunday, May 17"
    dates: 2026-05-16 Sat 2026-05-17 Sun
    effects: see-schedule "Victoria Day weekend schedule"
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim"
- IGNORED date-context "Monday, May 18"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim"
- NOTICE "The facility is closed and all programs cancelled."
    date text: "Monday, May 18"
    dates: 2026-05-18 Mon
    effects: cancelled, closure
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim"

== Deborah Anne Kirwan Pool special_hours
